step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Travel to Lunar Isle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the mine in the north-east area of Lunar Isle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Crawl through the cave entrance (Quest Quest minimap icon).</str>
line	
