line	
line	<str>Add your ground astral rune to the dream vial to complete the potion.</str>
line	
line	<str>Prepare for 4 fights. Prayers and emergency teleports won't work. Do not bank your Seal of Passage; not even 'Birds-Eye' Jack will serve you without it yet.</str>
line	
line	<str>Light the Ceremonial Brazier in the dream hall building.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Cyrisus</col>.</col>
step	24	-	Quick guide step 24
line	<str>Travel to Lunar Isle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the mine in the north-east area of Lunar Isle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Crawl through the cave entrance (Quest Quest minimap icon).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the fallen man, follow the dialogue and close the interface when it appears.</str>
line	
line	<str>Feed him 4 food, starting with one you have seven of, while cycling through your different foods. Avoid using the same food twice in a row.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Feed him 4 more food as before.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him and keep reassuring him with positive responses until he sits up (cutscene).</str>
line	
line	<str>Feed him 6 more food.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk again multiple times using positive responses until he stands up (cutscene), and once more after he stands up.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to 'Bird's-Eye' Jack in the bank.</str>
line	
line	<str>Select the following equipment (if your combat level is determined by your melee skills):</str>
line	
line	<str>Return and talk to Cyrisus for a cutscene.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use food on him until his health is at 100%.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him again multiple times, giving positive responses until you receive a cutscene. If you don't receive it, feed him a couple more times.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Oneiromancer at the Astral Altar for a dream vial.</str>
line	
line	<str>(Optional) Change your spellbook as necessary if you wish to use magic in the final fight.</str>
line	
line	<str>Fill the vial with water, add a goutweed.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your hammer on an Astral rune, then grind the shards with a pestle and mortar.</str>
line	
line	<str>Add your ground astral rune to the dream vial to complete the potion.</str>
line	
line	<str>Prepare for 4 fights. Prayers and emergency teleports won't work. Do not bank your Seal of Passage; not even 'Birds-Eye' Jack will serve you without it yet.</str>
line	
line	<str>Light the Ceremonial Brazier in the dream hall building.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Cyrisus.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>During the fight, you can leave at any time by using the lectern, although this will force you to re-battle any defeated bosses.</col>
